BT /F2 20.0 Tf 54.0 738.0 Td (Customer Guide: Install NGINX Plus Ingress for) Tj ET
BT /F2 20.0 Tf 54.0 714.0 Td (Kubernetes DNS) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 677.0 Td (This guide installs only the F5 NGINX Ingress Controller with NGINX Plus. It assumes Kubernetes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 663.0 Td (is already running and the DNS service is already deployed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 640.0 Td (The goal is to expose an existing Kubernetes DNS service on TCP and UDP port 53 using F5 NGINX) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 626.0 Td (`GlobalConfiguration` and `TransportServer` resources.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14.0 Tf 54.0 595.0 Td (Assumptions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 570.0 Td (- Kubernetes cluster is ready.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 556.0 Td (- `kubectl` is configured for the target cluster.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 542.0 Td (- Helm is installed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 528.0 Td (- The DNS backend service already exists.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 514.0 Td (- The customer has a valid NGINX Plus JWT license token.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 500.0 Td (- The cluster nodes can pull from `private-registry.nginx.com`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 481.0 Td (Example backend used in this guide:) Tj ET
BT /F3 7.5 Tf 62.0 455.0 Td (DNS namespace: dns-lab) Tj ET
BT /F3 7.5 Tf 62.0 445.0 Td (DNS service:   coredns) Tj ET
BT /F3 7.5 Tf 62.0 435.0 Td (DNS port:      53) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 412.0 Td (If the customer DNS service has different names, replace:) Tj ET
BT /F3 7.5 Tf 62.0 386.0 Td (dns-lab/coredns:53) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 363.0 Td (with:) Tj ET
BT /F3 7.5 Tf 62.0 337.0 Td (<dns-namespace>/<dns-service>:<dns-port>) Tj ET
BT /F2 14.0 Tf 54.0 306.0 Td (1. Verify the Existing DNS Service) Tj ET
BT /F3 7.5 Tf 62.0 278.0 Td (kubectl -n dns-lab get svc coredns) Tj ET
BT /F3 7.5 Tf 62.0 268.0 Td (kubectl -n dns-lab get endpoints coredns) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 245.0 Td (The service must expose both protocols:) Tj ET
BT /F3 7.5 Tf 62.0 219.0 Td (53/TCP) Tj ET
BT /F3 7.5 Tf 62.0 209.0 Td (53/UDP) Tj ET
BT /F2 14.0 Tf 54.0 178.0 Td (2. Create NGINX Plus Secrets) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 153.0 Td (Save the NGINX Plus JWT locally as:) Tj ET
BT /F3 7.5 Tf 62.0 127.0 Td (license.jwt) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 104.0 Td (Create the NGINX namespace:) Tj ET
BT /F3 7.5 Tf 62.0 78.0 Td (kubectl create namespace nginx-ingress --dry-run=client -o yaml | kubectl apply -f -) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 286.0 28 Td (Page 1) Tj ET
endstream
