BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 738.0 Td (Notes:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 715.0 Td (- `hostNetwork: true` binds NGINX directly on the Kubernetes node network.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 701.0 Td (- Port `53` must be free on the nodes where this DaemonSet runs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.0 687.0 Td (- If another DNS service is already listening on node port `53`, this deployment will fail.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14.0 Tf 54.0 660.0 Td (4. Install NGINX Plus Ingress Controller) Tj ET
